cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "ERRE-Sandbox を研究で利用した場合は以下を引用してください。"
title: "ERRE-Sandbox"
abstract: >-
  A local-LLM multi-agent research apparatus that re-implements the cognitive habits of
  historical thinkers as agents in a 3D space, in order to study deliberate inefficiency
  and embodied return. The system separates a deterministic simulation plane (physics,
  memory geometry, RNG, clocks, identifiers) from a recorded/replayed LLM-invocation
  plane, which allows byte-identical reproduction of runs across operating systems even
  though a non-deterministic language model sits inside the loop.
type: software
